{"data": [{"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:12:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115808999945736701"], "id": "2115808999945736701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 84, "impression_count": 28644, "like_count": 479, "quote_count": 11, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 47}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115796060966715493", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "here's you regular reminder that carseats have probably saved very few lives in aggregate vs. general improvements in road and care safety\n\ndespite massive increases in carseats for 0 &amp; 3 year olds since 1959, their mortality declines have been entirely typical https://t.co/9Bz09ZB7sY https://t.co/TZnALGmyav", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115808999945736701"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:46:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115802371104313664"], "id": "2115802371104313664", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 5373, "like_count": 230, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "the kids (3, 5, 6) cooked their own food over the campfire last night then slept outside in a tent without adult supervision. cooked their eggs in the campfire ashes this AM.\n\nwent great, going for round 2 tonight.\n\nyour kids can just do things.", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115802371104313664"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:21:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115796060966715493"], "id": "2115796060966715493", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 55977, "like_count": 779, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115772691193938179", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "i'm extremely confident a decline in car accident deaths of 19 year olds is not due to carseats https://t.co/CUQxMcANWD", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115796060966715493"}, {"author_id": "17217640", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:48:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115772815206912327"], "id": "2115772815206912327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 6583, "like_count": 65, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "A spacewalk is about to get underway at the International Space Station. NASA astronaut Anil Menon and Canadian Space Agency astronaut Joshua Kutryk will install and unfurl the 7th of 8 International Space Station Roll-Out Solar Arrays, or IROSAs. https://t.co/eXvklIsd23 https://t.co/09PBJK1Qfi", "url": "https://x.com/SpaceflightNow/status/2115772815206912327"}, {"author_id": "21436960", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:21:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115765869196251319"], "id": "2115765869196251319", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 13781, "like_count": 102, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "We’ve signed three new contracts in Norway to strengthen the resilience of satellite navigation. 🛰️🇳🇴\n\nThe projects focus on GNSS interference testing, maritime navigation and drones operating in challenging environments.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/ul22HvYZAr https://t.co/NqseR2KU42", "url": "https://x.com/esa/status/2115765869196251319"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-10-29T10:31:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115753332958433574"], "id": "2115753332958433574", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 186, "impression_count": 1240007, "like_count": 3441, "quote_count": 82, "reply_count": 240, "retweet_count": 578}, "text": "LIVE: NASA's Anil Menon and @csa_asc's Joshua Kutryk are setting up a new solar array outside the @Space_Station. Today's spacewalk is scheduled to start around 8am ET (1200 UTC) and run for about six and a half hours. https://t.co/xoJPYWty9Z", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2115753332958433574"}, {"author_id": "610659001", "created_at": "2026-10-29T09:53:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115743768510886379"], "id": "2115743768510886379", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 944, "impression_count": 220064, "like_count": 2260, "quote_count": 117, "reply_count": 79, "retweet_count": 569}, "text": "What is life like at different levels of GDP per capita?\n\nIn this new chart I visualised it for 12 different dimensions. https://t.co/BaAp2k3TXA", "url": "https://x.com/MaxCRoser/status/2115743768510886379"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-29T03:28:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115647034908635582"], "id": "2115647034908635582", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 3972, "like_count": 37, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115639571270812064", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Okay that’s amusing https://t.co/DNkiAETaCt", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115647034908635582"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-29T02:00:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115624826081616290"], "id": "2115624826081616290", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 5228, "like_count": 184, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 4}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115594385706373475", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "They got caught because they posted videos online https://t.co/QNn1nvD0cu", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115624826081616290"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-29T01:09:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115611837068681525"], "id": "2115611837068681525", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 11478, "like_count": 262, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 23}, "text": "Young Koreans want love but they don’t want babies https://t.co/eE6iKTQaF2", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2115611837068681525"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:51:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115607323775582555"], "id": "2115607323775582555", "public_metrics":